<title>NORWAY: Dyno sees 1 bln NOK op.profit by 2000.</title>
<headline>Dyno sees 1 bln NOK op.profit by 2000.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian industrial group Dyno Industrier ASA said on Friday it hoped to achieve operating profits of a minimum 1.0 billion crowns by the year 2000 thanks to an improvement programme.</p>
</text>
